00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,471
Why combinations?

2
00:00:01,471 --> 00:00:07,005
Because a plus b to the fifth is five brackets multiplied together.

3
00:00:07,005 --> 00:00:12,773
To make a term a cubed b squared, you take b from two of the brackets and a from the other three.

4
00:00:12,773 --> 00:00:17,851
The number of ways to choose those two brackets is five C two, ten.

5
00:00:17,851 --> 00:00:20,976
So a cubed b squared appears ten times.

